claim.claim-text:
the soluble tapioca flour composition comprises a carbohydrate content ranging from 90 to 98 wt%, a protein content ranging from 0.5 to 1.5 wt%, a fat content of less than 1 wt%, and an insoluble fiber content ranging from 0.5 to 3.5 wt%;
the flavor encapsulation is a flavor emulsion; and
the soluble tapioca flour is at least a partial replacement or full replacement of maltodextrin.
